{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1779844789,"nonce":"wpCyg/vyLy6kyl0BRNgPj9fK9Hg=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABDe4_cQ","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/184","origin":"github"},"title":"Bizzy nav2 instance overlay: move sensor-rig + reflex out of generic base","message":"## Summary\n\nMove BizzyBoat's nav2 **sensor-rig + reflex** config out of the generic\n`echoboat_project11` base and into a BizzyBoat instance overlay, using the new\n`instance_params` composition layer added in seafloor-side step 1/2.\n\nPart of rolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11#3 (step 2 — the cross-repo cutover).\n\n## What moves here\n\nInto a new `bizzyboat_project11/config/nav2_overlay.yaml` (merged on top of the generic\n`base + per-model` params at launch):\n\n- `local_costmap` `plugins` list (the 4-OAK variant) + the 4 `sea_surface_layer_*`\n  definitions (forward/port/starboard/aft) — driven by Bizzy's camera rig.\n- `collision_monitor` **reflex response**: `CollisionSlowdown` / `CollisionStop`\n  polygons, `observation_sources`, `reflex_cloud`.\n\nThe `collision_monitor` **gating wiring** (`cmd_vel_nav` → monitor → helm, frames,\ntimeouts) stays in the generic base — both hulls route autonomous cmd_vel through it.\n\n`bizzyboat_project11/launch/nav_launch.py` passes `model:=240` and\n`instance_params:=\u003cthis overlay\u003e` to the generic `nav2_bringup_launch.py`.\n\n## Coordination (important)\n\nThis is one half of an atomic cross-repo cutover. The other half — reducing the\ngeneric base (removing the rig/reflex it currently carries) — is in\nrolker/seafloor_echoboat_project11#3 / PR #29. **The two must merge and deploy to the\nboat together**: if gabby pulls the seafloor base-reduction without this overlay,\nBizzyBoat loses its sea_surface layers and reflex polygons. Verified before opening:\nBizzy's composed params (`base + 240 + this overlay`) are identical to today's.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [ ] `bizzyboat_project11/config/nav2_overlay.yaml` carries the rig + reflex config.\n- [ ] `nav_launch.py` passes `model:=240` + `instance_params:=\u003coverlay\u003e`.\n- [ ] Bizzy composed params == pre-cutover (verified).\n- [ ] Deploys as a pair with the seafloor base-reduction PR.\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}